<title>GERMANY: TARKETT GP NET PROFIT UP AT 27.9 MLN DMK.</title>
<headline>TARKETT GP NET PROFIT UP AT 27.9 MLN DMK.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKENTHAL, Germany 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   27.9    vs 27.7</p>
<p>Group profit before goodwill</p>
<p>    write-off and financials		 64.2    vs 60.4</p>
<p>    Group sales				  753.6   vs 666</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German floor covering group is Tarkett AG.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
